  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping Help Guide\n\n### View VAT Transaction Detail\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 31 Aug, 2021 at  3:43 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:  Bookkeeping module > Dashboard > Client specific > VAT > VAT Transaction Detail\n\nClick here to watch the video\n\nHelp/Guide \n\nOn VAT transaction detail page, you can choose the period as a Current month, Last month, Current year, Last year. On the basis of the period chosen date will automatically change.\n\nYou can also filter by contact and ref No. and search invoice.\n\nYou can export the VAT report in PDF and Excel format\n\nThis page contains detailed VAT report transaction wise.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000185558\">Bookkeeping Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">View VAT Transaction Detail\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 31 Aug, 2021 at  3:43 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">: &nbsp;Bookkeeping module &gt; Dashboard &gt; Client specific &gt; VAT &gt; VAT Transaction Detail</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/ccffad6fed36495bbece940687bea19b\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><br></strong></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/ccffad6fed36495bbece940687bea19b\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Click here to watch the video</strong></span></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Help/Guide</u></strong> </p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">On VAT transaction detail page, you can choose the period as a Current month, Last month, Current year, Last year. On the basis of the period chosen date will automatically change.</span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can also filter by contact and ref No. and search invoice.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can export the VAT report in PDF and Excel format</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This page contains detailed VAT report transaction wise.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><div data-empty=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073937341/original/u4r200xwCENHc8_ez-xnfC8po-Npv_D8sw.png?1553188086\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073937341/original/u4r200xwCENHc8_ez-xnfC8po-Npv_D8sw.png?1553188086\" data-fileid=\"9073937341\" data-uniquekey=\"1553188055920\" style=\"width: 1059px;\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165236\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165236/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\